       "from": [
        "S05-B5"
       ],
       "bead": "S05-B5"
      },
      {
       "text": "紧绷暂时松开",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S05-B5"
       ],
       "bead": "S05-B5"
      },
      {
       "text": "不是已经想通",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S05-B5"
       ],
       "bead": "S05-B5"
      },
      {
       "text": "只是抵抗累了",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
